  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c723c535281824f3",
      "translationZh": "v1.2.0，MIT 许可证，个人项目。与 Claude Code、OpenCode 和 Crush 属于同一领域",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f90d32f8a983ca52",
      "translationZh": "它的灵感就来自这些项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "200d324038e1cd2e",
      "translationZh": "我写它，是因为我想要一个真正能按自己的想法来塑造的工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c7cc7c201d93f45",
      "translationZh": "面板、快捷键绑定、主题、针对每个工具的权限规则，以及工具调用前后的钩子，全都由配置决定，而不是由供应商替你选定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c508e4f6fef59d5",
      "translationZh": "它也主要是通过智能体构建的，大部分代码由 LLM 智能体编写，由我来指导和审查。这一点值得先说清楚，因为这正是我希望有外部人士帮忙审查的原因：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cba8fe1ed6516414",
      "translationZh": "这东西已经接受了大量机器审查，但人工审查者恰好只有一个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e043ebd835e8da1",
      "translationZh": "模型会在你的代码仓库中读取、写入和运行内容，每次会改变状态的调用都必须先经过权限提示。可以使用 Ollama 或 llama.cpp 运行，不需要密钥，也不会有任何数据离开 localhost；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02751c893e9e8beb",
      "translationZh": "也支持托管服务提供商。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ca27213de3debdf",
      "translationZh": "所以，权限模型、沙箱隔离、提供方层，还有 Go 本身。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22da477d28d28b28",
      "translationZh": "哪个环节看起来最薄弱，就从哪里下手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef62ed275e612f3e",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Practical_Witness_95 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
